<instruction name="VPDPBUSD">
 <copyright>Copyright (C) Intel Corporation. All Rights Reserved.</copyright>
 <shortdesc>Multiply and Add Unsigned and Signed Bytes</shortdesc>
 <longdesc><para unique="1046202">
   <string>Multiplies the individual unsigned bytes of the first source operand by the corresponding signed bytes of the second source operand, producing intermediate signed word results. The word results are then summed and accumulated in the destination dword element size operand.</string></para>
  <para unique="1046203">
   <string>This instruction supports memory fault suppression.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
